1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
A very good evening to all the wonderful people gathered over here.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:18,000
With immense pleasure and joy, I announce that today we are celebrating our very first annual day.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
On this occasion, it's my honor to welcome the guests of the day.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
My Chief guest, Mrs. Anjali Chaudhry-Partida, Director of Worldway International School,

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Mrs. Poonam-Rizada, Principal of Worldway International School,

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
I also welcome other special guests of the day.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Mrs. Benzer Sayyid, Director of Little Millennium Hushangabad Road, Mr. Abhishek Corbu,

8
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Director of Little Millennium Arirah Colony and Mrs. Ranjana Chaudhry,

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Academic Coordinator for Little Millennium Bhopal Centers.

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:01,000
I extend a warm welcome to the parents and grandparents who are here today

11
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
to encourage us to deliver our best.

12
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Thank you for being here.

13
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:14,000
As they say, coming together is a beginning, keeping together is progress,

14
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:17,000
and working together is success.

15
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:23,000
It was indeed this mantra of coming together that has brought us where we are today.

16
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:32,000
This is a very special year for us as we are completing the fifth year of our journey as a preschool,

17
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,000
and a lot has happened since then.

18
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:44,000
God has been really gracious to have chosen us as a channel to take care and nurture his most precious creation

19
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:50,000
and make sure that they be the most amazing human beings on this planet.

20
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Also, this journey would have been unthinkable without the immense trust

21
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:02,000
and unwavering support from you all, the parent community,

22
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:09,000
who have been a part of Little Millennium Rohit Nagar at some point or the other since 2019.

23
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:16,000
I would like to take a moment to express my heartfelt gratitude to all of you.

24
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Here, I would like to mention that life is not all about textbooks and bookish knowledge.

25
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:27,000
We need to learn many skills as well.

26
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Anil function provides all the children with an excellent opportunity to learn practical life skills

27
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:44,000
such as confidence, public speaking, leadership, coordination, teamwork, and so on.

28
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:50,000
And these are the skills that will lead our children ahead in life.

29
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:57,000
Today's program is a collective effort of the entire team of Little Millennium Rohit Nagar.

30
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Our super energetic children and their ever enthusiastic teachers have been practicing really hard

31
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:11,000
since almost a month to put their best foot forward on their annual day.

32
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:15,000
We are super proud of each one of them.

33
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:18,000
Let's give them a big round of applause.

34
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:33,000
Today, you will see the culmination of all the efforts that has gone into the execution of this program.

35
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:40,000
Another important fact that I wish to emphasize here today is that every child is unique

36
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:43,000
and should not be compared to another one.

37
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:49,000
All of our preschoolers are at a very tender age and most of them,

38
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:56,000
and for most of them, today's program will be their first formal performance on stage.

39
00:03:56,000 --> 00:04:05,000
So, our biggest task today is to give them enormous appreciation, motivation, and applause.

40
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Today's program will give you a variety of flavors from innocence to emotions, from bolivo and last, but not the least,

41
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:18,000
the unity and diversity of India.

42
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:27,000
So, ladies and gentlemen, sit back, fasten your seat belts and enjoy euphoria, a magical experience.

